{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":23.25,"text":"There are whales in the Mediterranean, which surprises almost everybody. When one washes ashore, scientists try to learn why it died, and then the skeleton is cleaned and kept. Standing next to it, you understand the size in a way no photograph gives you. Look at the bones near the tail, where the animal once had legs. Whales are descended from animals that walked on land.","words":[{"word":"There","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"are","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.9800000190734863},{"word":"whales","start":0.9800000190734863,"end":1.2999999523162842},{"word":"in","start":1.2999999523162842,"end":1.6200000047683716},{"word":"the","start":1.6200000047683716,"end":1.840000033378601},{"word":"Mediterranean","start":1.840000033378601,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"which","start":2.740000009536743,"end":2.9800000190734863},{"word":"surprises","start":2.9800000190734863,"end":3.5},{"word":"almost","start":3.5,"end":4},{"word":"everybody","start":4,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"When","start":5,"end":5.119999885559082},{"word":"one","start":5.119999885559082,"end":5.559999942779541},{"word":"washes","start":5.559999942779541,"end":5.619999885559082},{"word":"ashore","start":5.619999885559082,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"scientists","start":6.820000171661377,"end":6.820000171661377},{"word":"try","start":6.820000171661377,"end":7.099999904632568},{"word":"to","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"learn","start":7.519999980926514,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"why","start":7.519999980926514,"end":7.800000190734863},{"word":"it","start":7.800000190734863,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"died","start":8.239999771118164,"end":8.239999771118164},{"word":"and","start":8.5600004196167,"end":8.880000114440918},{"word":"then","start":8.880000114440918,"end":9.100000381469727},{"word":"the","start":9.100000381469727,"end":9.399999618530273},{"word":"skeleton","star